MANUSCRIPT SUMMARY — Claude reference file
Source: "Manuscript" (~39,300 words). Covers the opening through Dusty's third day of classes (the Solarium introduction with Head Maid Sylvain, and meeting Aelith in the Solarium that night).
Scene breaks in the manuscript are marked ***. POV is third limited; the POV character is noted per scene.

